{start_of_verse: V5}
{x_bars: 4}
[G]Voria anca tocarlo
[G]un fià el me fa impression
[G]no go gnanca capio se
[G]te si cativo o te si bon
{end_of_verse}

{chorus: C x4}

{start_of_grid: label="Pad x3" shape="4x4"}
